            "review_title": "Review at Poke Fresh",
            "review_text": "Brad G\nOrange, California13 contributions\n0\nFresh poke salads and juices\nMay 2018 • Friends\nI happened to be at the BLOQ when a friend and I decided to stop by Poke Fresh for lunch. It was a bit overwhelming with all the choices of proteins, rices, sauces, and vegetables, but it was no problem with the staff walking us through the ordering process.\n\nI had the three protein bowl with salmon, tuna, and spicy tuna (and they were very generous portions of fish) for just 165,000 VND. In addition to mango salsa, they also have several sauces such as Dynamite and I Love Vietnam sauce.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 29, 2018",
