            "review_title": "Review at Poke Fresh",
            "review_text": "Tuan Luu\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nReally fresh and healthy meal\nApr 2018 • Friends\nDropped by the BLOQ area to check the space out and decided to eat here since we didn’t feel like having a heavy meal. The ordering process can be intimidating if you have never had poke before, but the staffs made sure to walk us through it.\nFirst you can choose either salad or rice, or both, as your base. Never had matcha rice before and they offered us a sample, it was great with a hint of matcha!\nThen you choose your protein, I got salmon and spicy tuna. Salmon was really fresh and the spicy tuna was very flavorful!\nThe other toppings are pretty similar to elsewhere, but all very fresh such as cucumber, mango, etc!\nThey have a mix of sauces that they said are inspired by cuisines around asia. Very unusual poke sauces but all very flavorful!\nI got a mix of their classic sauce, Vietnam sauce (dill, yogurt, and fish sauce) and Dynamite for an extra kick!\nThe meal was awesome and did not make me feel heavy afterward. Will definitely be back or get their delivery option!\nRead more\nWritten April 3, 2018",
